# This pipeline reads no environment variables, and needs no API key.
#
# Every figure in results.json is read from the OCR shipped in data/ by rules
# in pipeline/, so there is no provider to authenticate against and nothing to
# set before running it:
#
#     pip install pymupdf pillow
#     python run.py
#
# The file is here because the brief asks for it, and because an empty one is
# the honest answer: "cost_eur_per_page": 0.0 in results.json means no model
# was called, not that a call was made cheaply.
#
# If a vision-model fallback were added for the pages the rules miss -- see
# "What I would do with a week" in README.md -- these are the names it would
# read, and they are listed so you can see which providers it would talk to.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
